quest.meet_the_sawyer.title = A Word with Marn
quest.meet_the_sawyer.flavor = There's a sawyer working the far side of the landing, and he's been down here longer than I have. Cross over and say hello.
quest.timber_rights.title = Timber Rights
quest.timber_rights.flavor = I've a Sawmill going spare, and I don't hand them to just anybody. Cut me planks by hand first, so you know what they cost. Then the mill's yours.
quest.first_cut.title = First Cut
quest.first_cut.flavor = You've a mill now. Feed it logs, work it till you've a stack of planks, and bring some back so I can see how you cut.
quest.reading_the_grain.title = Reading the Grain
quest.reading_the_grain.flavor = A log's got more than one cut in it and the mill knows every one. Crouch as you use the block and it'll ask which. Mill me plain planks, then the decorative, then the ornate.
quest.second_bench.title = A Second Mill
quest.second_bench.flavor = One mill's a start. Put a proper load of lumber through yours and bring me the sap it sweats out, and I'll find you another.
quest.deep_in_the_wood.title = Deep in the Wood
quest.deep_in_the_wood.flavor = Old wood holds more than planks. Work enough of it through the mill and something comes out that isn't bark and isn't sap. Bring me a load of that.
quest.a_finer_edge.title = A Finer Edge
quest.a_finer_edge.flavor = You've done the short jobs. Now do a long one. Stand at that mill till your arms know the work, and get your woodcutting up to where I'd call you a sawyer.
quest.standing_order.title = Standing Order
quest.standing_order.flavor = Same order every day: planks and bark, delivered here. Fill it and I'll pay you out of the yard. Miss a day, and it'll still be waiting tomorrow.
quest.straight_grain.title = Straight Grain
quest.straight_grain.flavor = I'm making you a hatchet, and a hatchet's a haft before it's anything else. Straight grain, no knots. Mill stock till you're sick of the sight of it, then bring me planks and I'll find a haft in the stack.
quest.cold_metal.title = Cold Metal
quest.cold_metal.flavor = Cobalt for the head, and cobalt doesn't come out of a log. Go find a furnace and bring me Cobalt Ingots, and don't let the mill go cold while you're away.
quest.the_fitting.title = The Fitting
quest.the_fitting.flavor = Haft and head, and now they've to be joined. Work a long shift, till the essence comes off the saw faster than you can pocket it, then bring me Heavy Leather and Greater Essence of Life. After that it's a hatchet.
quest.trim_work.title = Trim Work
quest.trim_work.flavor = Trim, this time. The decorative cut and the ornate, and keep the Plant Fiber the saw throws off while you're at it. Bring me a share of the trim and some bark. The order comes up again before the day's out.

quest.bounty_quick_mill.title = Quick Mill
quest.bounty_quick_mill.flavor = A short run at a Sawmill before the board turns over. Load it and stand there.
quest.bounty_quick_boards.title = Quick Boards
quest.bounty_quick_boards.flavor = A short stack of planks off a Sawmill, any cut. The Builder's Workbench will not do.
quest.bounty_mill_shift.title = Mill Shift
quest.bounty_mill_shift.flavor = The yard needs the Sawmill running for a while. Keep the logs coming.
quest.bounty_plank_delivery.title = Plank Delivery
quest.bounty_plank_delivery.flavor = The builders are short of planks and the board pays by the load. Any species, handed in here.
quest.bounty_lumber_order.title = Lumber Order
quest.bounty_lumber_order.flavor = A proper order of milled lumber, every cut welcome. Run the Sawmill until it is filled.
quest.bounty_essence_run.title = Essence off the Hatchet
quest.bounty_essence_run.flavor = The alchemists want Essence of Life straight off the hatchet. Mill old wood until enough shakes loose.
quest.bounty_mill_marathon.title = The Long Shift
quest.bounty_mill_marathon.flavor = A week at the Sawmill, and the board counts every log. Keep a big stack of them by the saw.

